## Comets for sale

@pim{code="0010" emotion="happy"}: Comets! Fresh-fallen, still warm! One token each, two for a wish!
@narrator{code="0010"}: A knight in black armour is standing at the edge of the market, very still, watching the comets like they owe her money.
@lumi{code="0010" emotion="surprised"}: Wishkeeper. That's Vesper. The Hollow King's lantern-bearer.
@vesper{code="0010" emotion="smug"}: Former. I'm between kings. Buy me a comet and I'll explain.
